msgid "<span id=\"quickstart\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"quickstart\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quickstart example {#quickstart-example}"
msgstr "Halimbawa ng Quickstart {#quickstart-example}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates the core idea. It creates a parametric circuit and"
" and five different parameter configurations. The executor runs all five "
"configurations and returns data organized by configuration, with one result "
"per classical register in each quantum program item.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng halimbawang ito ang pangunahing ideya. Lumilikha ito ng "
"parametric circuit at limang iba't ibang configuration ng parameter. "
"Pinapatakbo ng executor ang lahat ng limang configuration at nagbabalik ng "
"datos na nakaayos ayon sa configuration, na may isang resulta bawat "
"classical register sa bawat quantum program item.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The rest of this guide refers back to this example to explain how this works"
" and how to build more complex sweeps, including Samplomatic-based "
"randomization and inputs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Binabalikan ng natitirang bahagi ng gabay na ito ang halimbawang ito para "
"ipaliwanag kung paano ito gumagana at kung paano bumuo ng mas kumplikadong "
"mga sweep, kabilang ang Samplomatic-based na randomization at mga input.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Intrinsic and extrinsic axes {#intrinsic-and-extrinsic-axes}"
msgstr "Mga intrinsic at extrinsic na axis {#intrinsic-and-extrinsic-axes}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Broadcasting only applies to _extrinsic_ axes. The intrinsic axes are always"
" preserved as specified.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang broadcasting ay nalalapat lamang sa _extrinsic_ na mga axis. Ang mga "
"intrinsic na axis ay palaging pinapanatili ayon sa tinukoy.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Intrinsic axes** (rightmost): Determined by the data type. For example, if your circuit\n"
"has three parameters, then parameter values require three numbers, giving an intrinsic shape\n"
"of `(3,)`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga intrinsic na axis** (pinaka-kanan): Tinutukoy ng uri ng datos. Halimbawa, kung ang iyong circuit\n"
"ay may tatlong parameter, kung gayon ang mga halaga ng parameter ay nangangailangan ng tatlong numero, na nagbibigay ng intrinsic na hugis\n"
"na `(3,)`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Extrinsic axes** (leftmost): Your sweep dimensions. These define how many configurations you\n"
"want to run.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga extrinsic na axis** (pinaka-kaliwa): Ang iyong mga dimensyon ng sweep. Tinutukoy nito kung ilang configuration ang\n"
"gusto mong patakbuhin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Input type                               | Intrinsic shape | Example full shape                                  |\n"
"|----------------------------------------|---------------|---------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Parameter values (n parameters)          | (n,)            | (5, 3) for five configurations and three parameters |\n"
"| Scalar inputs (for example, noise scale) | ()              | (4,) for four configurations                        |\n"
"| Observables (if applicable)              | varies          | Depends on observable type                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Uri ng input                                      | Intrinsic na hugis | Halimbawa ng buong hugis                                          |\n"
"|--------------------------------------------------|-------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Mga halaga ng parameter (n na parameter)          | (n,)              | (5, 3) para sa limang configuration at tatlong parameter          |\n"
"| Mga scalar input (halimbawa, noise scale)         | ()                | (4,) para sa apat na configuration                                |\n"
"| Mga observable (kung naaangkop)                  | nag-iiba          | Depende sa uri ng observable                                      |\n"

