# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you provide inputs with extrinsic shapes `(4, 1)` and `(3,)`, the broadcast extrinsic\n"
"shape is `(4, 3)`. The following code uses a circuit with 1024 shots and a 4-bit classical register (as defined in the [Quickstart](#quickstart) example):\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung magbibigay ka ng mga input na may extrinsic na hugis na `(4, 1)` at `(3,)`, ang broadcast extrinsic\n"
"na hugis ay `(4, 3)`. Gumagamit ang sumusunod na code ng circuit na may 1024 shots at 4-bit na classical register (ayon sa tinukoy sa halimbawa ng [Quickstart](#quickstart)):\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Each configuration runs the full shot count specified in the quantum program. Shots are **not** divided among configurations. For example, if you request 1024 shots and have 10 configurations, each configuration runs 1024 shots (10,240 total shots executed).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Bawat configuration ay nagpapatakbo ng buong bilang ng shot na tinukoy sa quantum program. Ang mga shot ay **hindi** nahahati sa mga configuration. Halimbawa, kung hihilingin mo ang 1024 shots at mayroon kang 10 configuration, bawat configuration ay magpapatakbo ng 1024 shots (kabuuang 10,240 shots na naisagawa).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Randomization and the `shape` parameter {#randomization-and-the-shape-"
"parameter}"
msgstr ""
"Randomization at ang `shape` na parameter {#randomization-and-the-shape-"
"parameter}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When using a [samplex](/guides/directed-execution-model), each element of the extrinsic shape corresponds to an independent circuit\n"
"execution. The samplex typically injects randomness (for example, gate twirling) into each\n"
"execution, so even without explicitly requesting multiple randomizations, each element \n"
"receives a random realization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag gumagamit ng [samplex](/guides/directed-execution-model), bawat elemento ng extrinsic na hugis ay tumutugma sa isang independyenteng pagpapatakbo ng circuit.\n"
"Ang samplex ay karaniwang naglalagay ng randomness (halimbawa, gate twirling) sa bawat\n"
"pagpapatakbo, kaya kahit hindi ka tahasang humiling ng maraming randomization, bawat elemento\n"
"ay tumatanggap ng isang random na realisasyon.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `shape` parameter to augment the extrinsic shape for the item, effectively\n"
"adding axes that correspond specifically to randomizing the same configuration many times. It must be\n"
"broadcastable from the shape implicit in your `samplex_arguments`. Axes where `shape` exceeds\n"
"the implicit shape enumerate additional independent randomizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang `shape` na parameter para palawakin ang extrinsic na hugis para sa item, na epektibong\n"
"nagdadagdag ng mga axis na partikular na tumutugon sa pag-randomize ng parehong configuration nang maraming beses. Dapat itong\n"
"ma-broadcast mula sa hugis na implicit sa iyong `samplex_arguments`. Ang mga axis kung saan nalampasan ng `shape` ang\n"
"implicit na hugis ay nagtatala ng karagdagang mga independyenteng randomization.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "No explicit randomization axes {#no-explicit-randomization-axes}"
msgstr ""
"Walang tahasang mga axis ng randomization {#no-explicit-randomization-axes}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you omit `shape` (or set it to match your input shapes), you get one execution per\n"
"input configuration. Each execution is still randomized by the samplex, but with only a\n"
"single random realization you don't benefit from averaging over multiple randomizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung aalisin ang `shape` (o itakda ito para tumugma sa iyong mga hugis ng input), makakakuha ka ng isang pagpapatakbo bawat\n"
"configuration ng input. Bawat pagpapatakbo ay nira-randomize pa rin ng samplex, ngunit sa isang\n"
"solong random na realisasyon lamang, hindi ka makikinabang mula sa pag-average sa maraming randomization.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you're accustomed to enabling twirling with a simple flag like `twirling=True`, note that \n"
"the Executor requires you to explicitly request multiple randomizations with the `shape` argument to\n"
"allow your post-processing routines to get the benefits of averaging over multiple \n"
"randomizations. A single randomization (the default when `shape` is omitted) applies \n"
"random gates but typically offers no advantage over running the base circuit without \n"
"randomization.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kung sanay ka sa pag-enable ng twirling gamit ang simpleng flag tulad ng `twirling=True`, tandaan na\n"
"ang Executor ay nangangailangan na tahasang humiling ka ng maraming randomization gamit ang `shape` na argumento para\n"
"mapahintulutan ang iyong mga post-processing routine na makuha ang mga benepisyo ng pag-average sa maraming\n"
"randomization. Ang isang solong randomization (ang default kapag tinanggal ang `shape`) ay nag-aaplay ng\n"
"mga random na gate ngunit karaniwang walang kalamangan kumpara sa pagpapatakbo ng base circuit nang walang\n"
"randomization.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

